# Proprietary Torus (osu!lazer) font - drop your own licensed .woff2 files in
# public/fonts/ for local dev/builds, but never commit them (that would
# redistribute a paid font). They still build into dist/ and ship from there.
# See public/fonts/README.md. If THIS repo is private and you'd rather Vercel's
# git deploy pick them up automatically, delete this line and commit them.
public/fonts/*.woff2
